# chuck

--- Conductor_PassWalls | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_CONDUCTOR_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Chuck's Supers can go through walls for <!card.accessory.activeTicks.ticksAsSeconds> seconds!
now  Chuck's Supers can go through walls for 8 seconds!
  card.accessory.activeTicks.ticksAsSeconds  8  -> 8

--- Conductor_PassWalls | gadget | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Supers can go through walls for <!card.accessory.activeTicks.ticksAsSeconds> sec and leave a trail of fire dealing <!buddy.accessory.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage, which burns <!buddy.accessory.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds> sec!
now  Supers can go through walls for 8 sec and leave a trail of fire dealing 1200 damage, which burns 3 sec!
  card.accessory.activeTicks.ticksAsSeconds  8  -> 8
  buddy.accessory.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  1200  -> 1200
  buddy.accessory.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds  3  -> 3

--- Conductor_PassWalls | gadget | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  Super leaves a trail of fire, dealing <!buddy.accessory.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> damage, which burns for <!buddy.accessory.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds> sec!
now  Super leaves a trail of fire, dealing 1200 damage, which burns for 3 sec!
  buddy.accessory.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  1200  -> 1200
  buddy.accessory.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds  3  -> 3

--- Conductor_RemoveSign | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_CONDUCTOR_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Chuck removes the nearest Post and charges <!card.accessory.customValue1>% of his Super.
now  Chuck removes the nearest Post and charges 50% of his Super.
  card.accessory.customValue1  50  -> 50

--- Conductor_RemoveSign | gadget | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Chuck removes the nearest Post, recharges <!card.accessory.customValue1>% of his Super, and gains <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.shieldPercent>% shield for <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.durationTicks.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Chuck removes the nearest Post, recharges 50% of his Super, and gains 20% shield for 5 sec.
  card.accessory.customValue1  50  -> 50
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.shieldPercent  20  -> 20
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.durationTicks.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5

--- Conductor_RemoveSign | gadget | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Gain <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.shieldPercent>% shield for <!buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.durationTicks.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Gain 20% shield for 5 sec.
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.shieldPercent  20  -> 20
  buddy.accessory.statusEffectSelf.durationTicks.ticksAsSeconds  5  -> 5

--- Conductor_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_CONDUCTOR_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Each pole that hits an enemy deals <!card.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel> area damage.
now  Each pole that hits an enemy deals 1600 area damage.
  card.areaEffect.damage.scaleStatToLevel  1600  -> 1600

--- Conductor_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Chuck has unlimited range on his next dash and leaves clouds of damaging steam behind him! Main attacks shoot <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack> clouds of steam in a cone.
now  Chuck has unlimited range on his next dash and leaves clouds of damaging steam behind him! Main attacks shoot <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack> clouds of steam in a cone.
  card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack  -  -> 3

--- Conductor_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DIFF
raw  Chuck's main attack shoots <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack> clouds of steam in a cone.
now  Chuck's main attack shoots <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack> clouds of steam in a cone.
  card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.numBulletsInOneAttack  -  -> 3

