now  Placing a Pole slows <!card.trait.action.statusEffect.speedReducePercent>% any hit enemy for <!card.trait.action.statusEffect.durationTicks.ticksAsSeconds> sec and leaves an area which deals <!buddy.trait.areaEffect.damage.scaleByUltiDamage.scaleStatToLevel> damage over 4 sec.
