  buddy.trait.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds  4  -> 4

--- Conductor_unique | star power | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  Leaves an area which deals <!buddy.trait.areaEffect.damage.scaleByUltiDamage.scaleStatToLevel> damage over <!buddy.trait.areaEffect.timeMs.msAsSeconds> sec.
