--- Conductor_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_CONDUCTOR_2_DESC
raw  Dashing through enemies with his Super will also steal <!card.trait.value>% of their ammo.
now  Dashing through enemies with his Super will also steal 33;100% of their ammo.
  card.trait.value  33;100  -> 33

--- Conductor_unique_2 | star power | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  Dashing through enemies with his Super will also steal <!card.trait.value>% of their ammo, and dash speed is increased by <!buddy.trait.value>%.
now  Dashing through enemies with his Super will also steal 33;100% of their ammo, and dash speed is increased by 25%.
  card.trait.value  33;100  -> 33
  buddy.trait.value  25  -> 25

--- Conductor_unique_2 | star power | TID_CONDUCTOR_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
